be the projection of $S$ onto the $xy$-plane. The flux of $F$ across $S$ can be expressed in terms of a double integral as \n\n$$\n{∬}_{S}F\\cdot dS={∬}_{D}\\,\\,\\text{d}A.\n$$\n\nWhich of the following could be the missing expression?" 13194139533507 17592186045585 true] [17592186406458 1072 #uuid "0d7ee053-a1f8-527b-9332-a3761ff9b930" 13194139533507 17592186045585 true] [17592186406458 1074 "Since we have a closed surface, the positive orientation is outward-pointing by convention. So, \n\n- the upper surface ${S}_{1}:z=g(x,y)=1-\\sqrt{{x}^{2}+{y}^{2}}$ is oriented upward, and\n\n- the lower surface ${S}_{2}:z=h(x,y)=0$ is oriented downward.\n\nNow, we write down the flux across each of the surfaces separately.\n\n- Consider the upper cone ${S}_{1}.$\n\nWe compute the partial derivatives of $z=g(x,y):$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{∂g}{∂x} & =\\frac{∂}{∂x}(1-\\sqrt{{x}^{2}+{y}^{2}})=-\\frac{x}{\\sqrt{{x}^{2}+{y}^{2}}} \\\\ \\frac{∂g}{∂y} & =\\frac{∂}{∂y}(1-\\sqrt{{x}^{2}+{y}^{2}})=-\\frac{y}{\\sqrt{{x}^{2}+{y}^{2}}}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nIf we denote $F=⟨P,\\,Q,\\,R⟩,$ then\n\n$$\nP=z=1-\\sqrt{{x}^{2}+{y}^{2}},\\,Q=0,\\,R=2.\n$$\n\n \n\nAs a result, since the positive orientation is upward, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{∬}_{{S}_{1}}F\\cdot \\text{d}S & ={∬}_{D}(-P\\frac{∂g}{∂x}-Q\\frac{∂g}{∂y}+R)\\text{d}A \\\\  & ={∬}_{D}-(1-\\sqrt{{x}^{2}+{y}^{2}})\\cdot (-\\frac{x}{\\sqrt{{x}^{2}+{y}^{2}}})-0\\cdot (-\\frac{y}{\\sqrt{{x}^{2}+{y}^{2}}})+2\\,\\text{d}A \\\\  & ={∬}_{D}\\frac{x}{\\sqrt{{x}^{2}+{y}^{2}}}-x+2\\,\\text{d}A.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n- Consider the lower plane ${S}_{2}.$ \n\nSince the positive orientation is downward, the unit normal vector to the plane is $n=⟨0,0,-1⟩.$ As a result, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{∬}_{{S}_{2}}F\\cdot \\text{d}S & ={∬}_{{S}_{2}}F\\cdot n\\,\\text{d}S \\\\  & ={∬}_{D}⟨z,0,2⟩\\cdot ⟨0,0,-1⟩\\,\\text{d}A \\\\  & ={∬}_{D}-2\\,\\text{d}A.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the flux of $F$ across the entire surface is \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{∬}_{S}F\\cdot \\text{d}S & ={∬}_{{S}_{1}}F\\cdot \\text{d}S+{∬}_{{S}_{2}}F\\cdot \\text{d}S \\\\  & ={∬}_{D}\\frac{x}{\\sqrt{{x}^{2}+{y}^{2}}}-x+2\\,\\text{d}A+{∬}_{D}-2\\,\\text{d}A \\\\  & ={∬}_{D}\\frac{x}{\\sqrt{{x}^{2}+{y}^{2}}}-x\\,\\text{d}A.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533507 17592186045585 true] [17592186406459 1075 #edb/ref 17592186406460 13194139533507 17592186045585 true] [17592186406459 1075 #edb/ref 17592186406461 13194139533507 17592186045585 true] [17592186406459 1075 #edb/ref 17592186406462 13194139533507 17592186045585 true] [17592186406459 1075 #edb/ref 17592186406463 13194139533507 17592186045585 true] [17592186406459 1075 #edb/ref 17592186406464 13194139533507 17592186045585 true] [17592186406459 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533507 17592186045585 true] [17592186406459 1077 "selection" 13194139533507 17592186045585 true] [17592186406459 1079 #edb/ref 17592186406461 13194139533507 17592186045585 true] [17592186406459 1080 #uuid "1886a1f4-707b-5268-9cc1-ed7effda4966" 13194139533507 17592186045585 true] [17592186406460 1081 "\\frac{xy}{\\sqrt{{x}^{2}+{y}^{2}}}+2" 13194139533507 17592186045585 true] [17592186406460 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533507 17592186045585 true] [17592186406460 1084 #uuid "855f9cab-5970-5823-b1ec-e6f8c8330244" 13194139533507 17592186045585 true] [17592186406461 1081 "\\frac{x}{\\sqrt{{x}^{2}+{y}^{2}}}-x" 13194139533507 17592186045585 true] [17592186406461 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533507 17592186045585 true] [17592186406461 1084 #uuid "feb823c9-ae29-56b1-bece-172402691eda" 13194139533507 17592186045585 true] [17592186406462 1081 "x\\sqrt{{x}^{2}+{y}^{2}}+y" 13194139533507 17592186045585 true] [17592186406462 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533507 17592186045585 true] [17592186406462 1084 #uuid "6a9ee25f-ef8f-511d-86bf-e7005eafe934" 13194139533507 17592186045585 true] [17592186406463 1081 "\\frac{y}{\\sqrt{{x}^{2}+{y}^{2}}}-y" 13194139533507 17592186045585 true] [17592186406463 1083