lane is $n=⟨0,0,-1⟩.$ As a result, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{∬}_{{S}_{2}}F\\cdot \\text{d}S & ={∬}_{{S}_{2}}F\\cdot n\\,\\text{d}S \\\\  & ={∬}_{D}⟨{z}^{2},0,y⟩\\cdot ⟨0,0,-1⟩\\,\\text{d}A \\\\  & ={∬}_{D}-y\\,\\text{d}A.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the flux of $F$ across the entire surface is \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{∬}_{S}F\\cdot \\text{d}S & ={∬}_{{S}_{1}}F\\cdot \\text{d}S+{∬}_{{S}_{2}}F\\cdot \\text{d}S \\\\  & ={∬}_{D}x\\sqrt{4-{x}^{2}-{y}^{2}}+y\\,\\text{d}A+{∬}_{D}-y\\,\\text{d}A \\\\  & ={∬}_{D}x\\sqrt{4-{x}^{2}-{y}^{2}}\\,\\text{d}A.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533507 17592186045585 true] [17592186406473 1075 #edb/ref 17592186406474 13194139533507 17592186045585 true] [17592186406473 1075 #edb/ref 17592186406475 13194139533507 17592186045585 true] [17592186406473 1075 #edb/ref 17592186406476 13194139533507 17592186045585 true] [17592186406473 1075 #edb/ref 17592186406477 13194139533507 17592186045585 true] [17592186406473 1075 #edb/ref 17592186406478 13194139533507 17592186045585 true] [17592186406473 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533507 17592186045585 true] [17592186406473 1077 "selection" 13194139533507 17592186045585 true] [17592186406473 1079 #edb/ref 17592186406474 13194139533507 17592186045585 true] [17592186406473 1080 #uuid "55ff700f-c93e-5ab0-80b1-0ec031f0502f" 13194139533507 17592186045585 true] [17592186406474 1081 "x\\sqrt{4-{x}^{2}-{y}^{2}}" 13194139533507 17592186045585 true] [17592186406474 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533507 17592186045585 true] [17592186406474 1084 #uuid "263b1feb-971b-5d7f-8e46-5b3bc0e94dcc" 13194139533507 17592186045585 true] [17592186406475 1081 "y\\sqrt{4-{x}^{2}-{y}^{2}}" 13194139533507 17592186045585 true] [17592186406475 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533507 17592186045585 true] [17592186406475 1084 #uuid "cb4e563f-2961-582e-92cd-4ac00f3541da" 13194139533507 17592186045585 true] [17592186406476 1081 "\\frac{x}{\\sqrt{4-{x}^{2}-{y}^{2}}}" 13194139533507 17592186045585 true] [175921864064