ector to the plane is $n=⟨0,0,-1⟩.$ As a result, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{∬}_{{S}_{2}}F\\cdot \\text{d}S & ={∬}_{{S}_{2}}F\\cdot n\\,\\text{d}S \\\\  & ={∬}_{D}⟨0,-z,2y⟩\\cdot ⟨0,0,-1⟩\\,\\text{d}A \\\\  & ={∬}_{D}(-2y)\\,\\text{d}A.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the flux across the entire surface is \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{∬}_{S}F\\cdot \\text{d}S & ={∬}_{{S}_{1}}F\\cdot \\text{d}S+{∬}_{{S}_{2}}F\\cdot \\text{d}S \\\\  & ={∬}_{D}(3y-\\frac{4y}{\\sqrt{{x}^{2}+{y}^{2}}})\\,\\text{d}A+{∬}_{D}(-2y)\\,\\text{d}A \\\\  & ={∬}_{D}y-\\frac{4y}{\\sqrt{{x}^{2}+{y}^{2}}}\\,\\text{d}A.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533507 17592186045585 true] [17592186406480 1075 #edb/ref 17592186406481 13194139533507 17592186045585 true] [17592186406480 1075 #edb/ref 17592186406482 13194139533507 17592186045585 true] [17592186406480 1075 #edb/ref 17592186406483 13194139533507 17592186045585 true] [17592186406480 1075 #edb/ref 17592186406484 13194139533507 17592186045585 true] [17592186406480 1075 #edb/ref 17592186406485 13194139533507 17592186045585 true] [17592186406480 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533507 17592186045585 true] [17592186406480 1077 "selection" 13194139533507 17592186045585 true] [17592186406480 1079 #edb/ref 17592186406483 13194139533507 17592186045585 true] [17592186406480 1080 #uuid "d8800b1d-0dbb-5dd9-8914-c007ddb67ebc" 13194139533507 17592186045585 true] [17592186406481 1081 "-\\frac{4y}{\\sqrt{{x}^{2}+{y}^{2}}}" 13194139533507 17592186045585 true] [17592186406481 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533507 17592186045585 true] [17592186406481 1084 #uuid "86b9be73-bab1-55d5-99f8-7629e8fdfac0" 13194139533507 17592186045585 true] [17592186406482 1081 "2y+\\frac{4y}{\\sqrt{{x}^{2}+{y}^{2}}}" 13194139533507 17592186045585 true] [17592186406482 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533507 17592186045585 true] [17592186406482 1084 #uuid "03b65f71-c8ab-568a-a5b4-8a9e1e082302" 13194139533507 17592186045585 true] [17592186406483 1081 "y-\\frac{4y}{\\sqrt{{x}^{2}+{y}^{