e both sides on the given equation with respect to $x:$ \n\n$$\n{y}^{(3)}(x)=2y{y}^{′}\\operatorname{sin}⁡x+{y}^{2}\\operatorname{cos}⁡x\n$$\n\nWe can now find  ${y}^{(3)}(\\pi )$ by substituting in the known values:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{y}^{(3)}(\\pi ) & =2y(\\pi ){y}^{′}(\\pi )\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\pi )+{y}^{2}(\\pi )\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\pi ) \\\\  & =2(1)(-1)(0)+(1)^{2}(-1) \\\\  & =-1\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, we  substitute  the obtained values in  the Taylor series:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}y(x) & =y(\\pi )+(x-\\pi ){y}^{′}(\\pi )+\\frac{(x-\\pi )^{2}}{2!}{y}^{″}(\\pi )+\\frac{(x-\\pi )^{3}}{3!}{y}^{(3)}(\\pi )+⋯ \\\\  & =1+(x-\\pi )\\cdot (-1)+\\frac{(x-\\pi )^{2}}{2}\\cdot (0)+\\frac{(x-\\pi )^{3}}{6}\\cdot (-1)+… \\\\  & =1-(x-\\pi )-\\frac{1}{6}(x-\\pi )^{3}+⋯\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533507 17592186045585 true] [17592186406557 1075 #edb/ref 17592186406558 13194139533508 17592186405019 false] [17592186406557 1075 #edb/ref 17592186406558 13194139533507 17592186045585 true] [17592186406557 1075 #edb/ref 17592186406559 13194139533508 17592186405019 false] [17592186406557 1075 #edb/ref 17592186406559 13194139533507 17592186045585 true] [17592186406557 1075 #edb/ref 17592186406560 13194139533508 17592186405019 false] [17592186406557 1075 #edb/ref 17592186406560 13194139533507 17592186045585 true] [17592186406557 1075 #edb/ref 17592186406561 13194139533508 17592186405019 false] [17592186406557 1075 #edb/ref 17592186406561 13194139533507 17592186045585 true] [17592186406557 1075 #edb/ref 17592186406562 13194139533508 17592186405019 false] [17592186406557 1075 #edb/ref 17592186406562 13194139533507 17592186045585 true] [17592186406557 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533508 17592186405019 false] [17592186406557 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533507 17592186045585 true] [17592186406557 1077 "selection" 13194139533508 17592186405019 false] [17592186406557 1077 "selection" 13194139533507 17592186045585 true] [17592186406557 1079 #edb/ref 175921864